.*/
# 团队角色定义和共享合同入库；本地配置、运行进度及其他私有技能仍忽略。
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/agent-team/
.claude/agent-team/*
!.claude/agent-team/README.md
!.claude/agent-team/team-review.md
!.claude/agent-team/config.example.json
!.claude/agent-team/check.ps1
!.claude/agent-team/check.tests.ps1
!.claude/agent-team/runtime.ps1
!.claude/agent-team/runtime.tests.ps1
!.claude/agent-team/branches.ps1
# 运行进度在 .workflow/（不在 .claude 下，避开 Claude Code 受保护路径审批）；只入库 README。
!.workflow/
.workflow/*
!.workflow/README.md
# DSH 团队合同与角色提示入库；技能、本地配置与其他私有资料仍忽略。
!.dsh/
.dsh/*
!.dsh/team/
.dsh/team/*
!.dsh/team/README.md
!.dsh/team/team-review.md
!.dsh/team/program.md
!.dsh/team/config.example.json
!.dsh/team/check.ps1
!.dsh/team/check.tests.ps1
!.dsh/team/runtime.ps1
!.dsh/team/runtime.tests.ps1
!.dsh/team/branches.ps1
!.dsh/team/roles/
!.dsh/team/roles/*.md
build/
build-dsh-alignment/
build-debug/
review-build*/
review-16-*/
build-review-fixes-10*/
artifacts/
*.png.orig
build-16/
